{"id":"d23de16d018bc884","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-forcing10-trunk-of-condition.md","title":"ZFC Forcing10 Trunk Of Condition","display":"df-zfc-forcing10-trunk-of-condition — ZFC Forcing10 Trunk Of Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-trunk-of-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing10-trunk-of-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing10-trunk-of-condition — ZFC Forcing10 Trunk Of Condition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-trunk-of-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing10-trunk-of-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing10-trunk-of-condition — ZFC Forcing10 Trunk Of Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,p,P,\\operatorname{trunk}\\in V\">\\(t,p,P,\\operatorname{trunk}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10TrunkOfCondition}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10TrunkOfCondition}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}trunk\\text{-}of\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10TrunkOfCondition}_S(t,p,P,\\operatorname{trunk})\\leftrightarrow p\\in P\\land\\exists Y\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{trunk},P,Y)\\land t=\\operatorname{trunk}(p))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}trunk\\text{-}of\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10TrunkOfCondition}_S(t,p,P,\\operatorname{trunk})\\leftrightarrow p\\in P\\land\\exists Y\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{trunk},P,Y)\\land t=\\operatorname{trunk}(p))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A trunk is meaningful only relative to a designated trunk map on the forcing carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed"